WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.2 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand strategy and promise

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your brand promise is the experience you deliver every time, backed by evidence.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Promise only what you can deliver.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Back each message with a proof point.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. List the claims you will never make.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita Weavers: every piece handwoven by a named member weaver, paid fairly and on time.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your brand platform and the promises you avoid.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
